{"seq":3,"slug":"espresso","title":"Espresso UI 测试框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/testing/espresso","wordCount":586,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"espresso-ui-测试框架\">Espresso UI 测试框架</h1><p>Espresso 是 Android 传统 View 体系的 UI 测试框架，提供可靠的同步机制和丰富的匹配器。尽管 Jetpack Compose 有自己的测试框架，但在混合项目中或测试非 Compose UI 时，Espresso 仍然不可或缺。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Espresso 围绕四个核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>三步结构</strong>：<code>onView</code> 定位视图（ViewMatcher）→ <code>perform</code> 执行操作（ViewAction）→ <code>check</code> 验证结果（ViewAssertion）。</li>\n<li><strong>自动同步与 Idling Resource</strong>：Espresso 在 UI 空闲时才执行操作；自定义异步操作需通过 <code>IdlingResource</code> 主动通知空闲/忙碌状态。</li>\n<li><strong>Intent 测试</strong>：Espresso-Intents 的 <code>intended()</code> 验证发出的 Intent，<code>intending()</code> 模拟 Intent 响应，适合页面跳转与系统交互测试。</li>\n<li><strong>可扩展匹配器</strong>：内置匹配器不够时用 <code>BoundedMatcher</code> 自定义；Espresso 与 Compose Testing 可在同一测试中共存。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"viewmatchers-viewactions-viewassertions\">ViewMatchers / ViewActions / ViewAssertions</h2><p>Espresso 测试由三个核心部分组成：查找视图、执行操作、验证结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)&#10;class LoginActivityTest {&#10;&#10;    @get:Rule&#10;    val activityRule = ActivityScenarioRule(LoginActivity::class.java)&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun loginFlow_withValidCredentials_navigatesToHome() {&#10;        onView(withId(R.id.username_input))&#10;            .perform(typeText(&quot;admin&quot;), closeSoftKeyboard())&#10;&#10;        onView(withId(R.id.password_input))&#10;            .perform(typeText(&quot;password123&quot;), closeSoftKeyboard())&#10;&#10;        onView(withId(R.id.login_button))&#10;            .perform(click())&#10;&#10;        onView(withId(R.id.welcome_text))&#10;            .check(matches(withText(containsString(&quot;欢迎&quot;))))&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun loginButton_disabled_whenFieldsEmpty() {&#10;        onView(withId(R.id.login_button))&#10;            .check(matches(not(isEnabled())))&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun errorMessage_shown_withInvalidCredentials() {&#10;        onView(withId(R.id.username_input))&#10;            .perform(typeText(&quot;wrong&quot;), closeSoftKeyboard())&#10;        onView(withId(R.id.password_input))&#10;            .perform(typeText(&quot;wrong&quot;), closeSoftKeyboard())&#10;        onView(withId(R.id.login_button))&#10;            .perform(click())&#10;&#10;        onView(withText(&quot;用户名或密码错误&quot;))&#10;            .check(matches(isDisplayed()))&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class LoginActivityTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @get:Rule</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val activityRule = ActivityScenarioRule(LoginActivity::class.java)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun loginFlow_withValidCredentials_navigatesToHome() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onView(withId(R.id.username_input))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .perform(typeText(\"admin\"), closeSoftKeyboard())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onView(withId(R.id.password_input))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .perform(typeText(\"password123\"), closeSoftKeyboard())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onView(withId(R.id.login_button))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .perform(click())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onView(withId(R.id.welcome_text))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .check(matches(withText(containsString(\"欢迎\"))))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun loginButton_disabled_whenFieldsEmpty() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onView(withId(R.id.login_button))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .check(matches(not(isEnabled())))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun errorMessage_shown_withInvalidCredentials() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onView(withId(R.id.username_input))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .perform(typeText(\"wrong\"), closeSoftKeyboard())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onView(withId(R.id.password_input))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .perform(typeText(\"wrong\"), closeSoftKeyboard())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onView(withId(R.id.login_button))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .perform(click())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onView(withText(\"用户名或密码错误\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .check(matches(isDisplayed()))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[onView] --&gt; B[ViewMatcher]&#10;    B --&gt; C{操作类型}&#10;    C --&gt;|perform| D[ViewAction]&#10;    C --&gt;|check| E[ViewAssertion]&#10;&#10;    D --&gt; F[click / typeText / swipe]&#10;    E --&gt; G[matches / doesNotExist]&#10;&#10;    classDef espressoStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class A espressoStyle\">graph LR\n    A[onView] --&gt; B[ViewMatcher]\n    B --&gt; C{操作类型}\n    C --&gt;|perform| D[ViewAction]\n    C --&gt;|check| E[ViewAssertion]\n\n    D --&gt; F[click / typeText / swipe]\n    E --&gt; G[matches / doesNotExist]\n\n    classDef espressoStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class A espressoStyle</pre><p>常用 ViewMatcher：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>匹配器</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>withId()</code></td>\n<td>通过 ID 匹配</td>\n<td><code>withId(R.id.button)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>withText()</code></td>\n<td>通过文本匹配</td>\n<td><code>withText(&quot;登录&quot;)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>withContentDescription()</code></td>\n<td>通过描述匹配</td>\n<td><code>withContentDescription(&quot;返回&quot;)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>withClassName()</code></td>\n<td>通过类名匹配</td>\n<td><code>withClassName(endsWith(&quot;EditText&quot;))</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>isDisplayed()</code></td>\n<td>是否可见</td>\n<td>作为断言使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>isEnabled()</code></td>\n<td>是否可用</td>\n<td>作为断言使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>allOf()</code></td>\n<td>组合多个匹配器</td>\n<td><code>allOf(withId(R.id.x), isDisplayed())</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>常用 ViewAction：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>点击</td>\n<td><code>click()</code></td>\n<td>单击视图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输入文本</td>\n<td><code>typeText(&quot;text&quot;)</code></td>\n<td>输入并获取焦点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>替换文本</td>\n<td><code>replaceText(&quot;text&quot;)</code></td>\n<td>直接替换文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关闭键盘</td>\n<td><code>closeSoftKeyboard()</code></td>\n<td>收起软键盘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滑动</td>\n<td><code>swipeLeft()</code> / <code>swipeRight()</code></td>\n<td>水平滑动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滚动</td>\n<td><code>scrollTo()</code></td>\n<td>滚动到可见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长按</td>\n<td><code>longClick()</code></td>\n<td>长按视图</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"idling-resources\">Idling Resources</h2><p>Espresso 的自动同步机制确保在 UI 空闲时才执行操作。对于自定义异步操作，需要通过 Idling Resource 通知 Espresso。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class DataLoadingIdlingResource : IdlingResource {&#10;&#10;    @Volatile&#10;    private var isIdle = true&#10;    private var callback: IdlingResource.ResourceCallback? = null&#10;&#10;    override fun getName(): String = &quot;DataLoadingIdlingResource&quot;&#10;&#10;    override fun isIdleNow(): Boolean = isIdle&#10;&#10;    override fun registerIdleTransitionCallback(callback: IdlingResource.ResourceCallback) {&#10;        this.callback = callback&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fun setIdle(idle: Boolean) {&#10;        isIdle = idle&#10;        if (idle) callback?.onTransitionToIdle()&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;class OkHttpIdlingResource private constructor(&#10;    private val dispatcher: okhttp3.Dispatcher&#10;) : IdlingResource {&#10;&#10;    override fun getName(): String = &quot;OkHttp&quot;&#10;&#10;    override fun isIdleNow(): Boolean = dispatcher.runningCallsCount() == 0&#10;&#10;    override fun registerIdleTransitionCallback(callback: IdlingResource.ResourceCallback) {&#10;        dispatcher.idleCallback = Runnable { callback.onTransitionToIdle() }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    companion object {&#10;        fun create(client: OkHttpClient): OkHttpIdlingResource {&#10;            return OkHttpIdlingResource(client.dispatcher)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)&#10;class ArticleListTest {&#10;&#10;    private val idlingResource = DataLoadingIdlingResource()&#10;&#10;    @Before&#10;    fun setup() {&#10;        IdlingRegistry.getInstance().register(idlingResource)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @After&#10;    fun teardown() {&#10;        IdlingRegistry.getInstance().unregister(idlingResource)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun articleList_showsAfterLoading() {&#10;        onView(withId(R.id.article_list))&#10;            .check(matches(isDisplayed()))&#10;        onView(withText(&quot;文章标题&quot;))&#10;            .check(matches(isDisplayed()))&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class DataLoadingIdlingResource : IdlingResource {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Volatile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private var isIdle = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private var callback: IdlingResource.ResourceCallback? = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun getName(): String = \"DataLoadingIdlingResource\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun isIdleNow(): Boolean = isIdle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun registerIdleTransitionCallback(callback: IdlingResource.ResourceCallback) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        this.callback = callback</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun setIdle(idle: Boolean) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        isIdle = idle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (idle) callback?.onTransitionToIdle()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class OkHttpIdlingResource private constructor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val dispatcher: okhttp3.Dispatcher</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : IdlingResource {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun getName(): String = \"OkHttp\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun isIdleNow(): Boolean = dispatcher.runningCallsCount() == 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun registerIdleTransitionCallback(callback: IdlingResource.ResourceCallback) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        dispatcher.idleCallback = Runnable { callback.onTransitionToIdle() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    companion object {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fun create(client: OkHttpClient): OkHttpIdlingResource {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return OkHttpIdlingResource(client.dispatcher)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class ArticleListTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val idlingResource = DataLoadingIdlingResource()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Before</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun setup() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        IdlingRegistry.getInstance().register(idlingResource)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @After</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun teardown() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        IdlingRegistry.getInstance().unregister(idlingResource)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun articleList_showsAfterLoading() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onView(withId(R.id.article_list))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .check(matches(isDisplayed()))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onView(withText(\"文章标题\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .check(matches(isDisplayed()))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Espresso&#10;    participant IdlingResource&#10;    participant 异步操作&#10;&#10;    Espresso-&gt;&gt;IdlingResource: isIdleNow()?&#10;    IdlingResource--&gt;&gt;Espresso: false (忙碌)&#10;    Note over Espresso: 等待...&#10;    异步操作-&gt;&gt;IdlingResource: setIdle(true)&#10;    IdlingResource-&gt;&gt;Espresso: onTransitionToIdle()&#10;    Espresso-&gt;&gt;Espresso: 执行下一步操作\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Espresso\n    participant IdlingResource\n    participant 异步操作\n\n    Espresso-&gt;&gt;IdlingResource: isIdleNow()?\n    IdlingResource--&gt;&gt;Espresso: false (忙碌)\n    Note over Espresso: 等待...\n    异步操作-&gt;&gt;IdlingResource: setIdle(true)\n    IdlingResource-&gt;&gt;Espresso: onTransitionToIdle()\n    Espresso-&gt;&gt;Espresso: 执行下一步操作</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"intent-测试\">Intent 测试</h2><p>Espresso-Intents 扩展库允许验证和模拟 Intent 交互。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)&#10;class ShareActivityTest {&#10;&#10;    @get:Rule&#10;    val intentsRule = IntentsRule()&#10;&#10;    @get:Rule&#10;    val activityRule = ActivityScenarioRule(ArticleActivity::class.java)&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun shareButton_sendsCorrectIntent() {&#10;        onView(withId(R.id.share_button)).perform(click())&#10;&#10;        intended(allOf(&#10;            hasAction(Intent.ACTION_SEND),&#10;            hasType(&quot;text/plain&quot;),&#10;            hasExtra(Intent.EXTRA_TEXT, containsString(&quot;https://&quot;))&#10;        ))&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun cameraButton_launchesCamera() {&#10;        val resultData = Intent().apply {&#10;            putExtra(&quot;photo_uri&quot;, &quot;content://photo/1&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;        intending(hasAction(MediaStore.ACTION_IMAGE_CAPTURE))&#10;            .respondWith(Instrumentation.ActivityResult(Activity.RESULT_OK, resultData))&#10;&#10;        onView(withId(R.id.camera_button)).perform(click())&#10;&#10;        onView(withId(R.id.photo_preview))&#10;            .check(matches(isDisplayed()))&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class ShareActivityTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @get:Rule</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val intentsRule = IntentsRule()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @get:Rule</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val activityRule = ActivityScenarioRule(ArticleActivity::class.java)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun shareButton_sendsCorrectIntent() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onView(withId(R.id.share_button)).perform(click())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        intended(allOf(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            hasAction(Intent.ACTION_SEND),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            hasType(\"text/plain\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            hasExtra(Intent.EXTRA_TEXT, containsString(\"https://\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun cameraButton_launchesCamera() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val resultData = Intent().apply {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            putExtra(\"photo_uri\", \"content://photo/1\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        intending(hasAction(MediaStore.ACTION_IMAGE_CAPTURE))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .respondWith(Instrumentation.ActivityResult(Activity.RESULT_OK, resultData))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onView(withId(R.id.camera_button)).perform(click())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onView(withId(R.id.photo_preview))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .check(matches(isDisplayed()))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>函数</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>intended()</code></td>\n<td>验证 Intent 已发送</td>\n<td>断言</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>intending()</code></td>\n<td>模拟 Intent 响应</td>\n<td>Stub</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>hasAction()</code></td>\n<td>匹配 action</td>\n<td><code>Intent.ACTION_SEND</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>hasExtra()</code></td>\n<td>匹配 extra 数据</td>\n<td><code>EXTRA_TEXT</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>hasType()</code></td>\n<td>匹配 MIME 类型</td>\n<td><code>&quot;text/plain&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"自定义匹配器\">自定义匹配器</h2><p>当内置匹配器不够用时，可以创建自定义匹配器。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun withItemCount(expectedCount: Int): Matcher&lt;View&gt; {&#10;    return object : BoundedMatcher&lt;View, RecyclerView&gt;(RecyclerView::class.java) {&#10;        override fun describeTo(description: Description) {&#10;            description.appendText(&quot;RecyclerView should have $expectedCount items&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        override fun matchesSafely(view: RecyclerView): Boolean {&#10;            return view.adapter?.itemCount == expectedCount&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fun atPosition(position: Int, itemMatcher: Matcher&lt;View&gt;): Matcher&lt;View&gt; {&#10;    return object : BoundedMatcher&lt;View, RecyclerView&gt;(RecyclerView::class.java) {&#10;        override fun describeTo(description: Description) {&#10;            description.appendText(&quot;has item at position $position: &quot;)&#10;            itemMatcher.describeTo(description)&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        override fun matchesSafely(view: RecyclerView): Boolean {&#10;            val viewHolder = view.findViewHolderForAdapterPosition(position)&#10;            return viewHolder != null &amp;&amp; itemMatcher.matches(viewHolder.itemView)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Test&#10;fun recyclerView_displaysCorrectItems() {&#10;    onView(withId(R.id.article_list))&#10;        .check(matches(withItemCount(10)))&#10;&#10;    onView(withId(R.id.article_list))&#10;        .check(matches(atPosition(0, hasDescendant(withText(&quot;第一篇文章&quot;)))))&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun withItemCount(expectedCount: Int): Matcher&#x3C;View> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return object : BoundedMatcher&#x3C;View, RecyclerView>(RecyclerView::class.java) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        override fun describeTo(description: Description) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            description.appendText(\"RecyclerView should have $expectedCount items\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        override fun matchesSafely(view: RecyclerView): Boolean {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return view.adapter?.itemCount == expectedCount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun atPosition(position: Int, itemMatcher: Matcher&#x3C;View>): Matcher&#x3C;View> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return object : BoundedMatcher&#x3C;View, RecyclerView>(RecyclerView::class.java) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        override fun describeTo(description: Description) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            description.appendText(\"has item at position $position: \")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            itemMatcher.describeTo(description)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        override fun matchesSafely(view: RecyclerView): Boolean {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val viewHolder = view.findViewHolderForAdapterPosition(position)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return viewHolder != null &#x26;&#x26; itemMatcher.matches(viewHolder.itemView)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun recyclerView_displaysCorrectItems() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    onView(withId(R.id.article_list))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .check(matches(withItemCount(10)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    onView(withId(R.id.article_list))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .check(matches(atPosition(0, hasDescendant(withText(\"第一篇文章\")))))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在混合 Compose + View 的项目中，可以同时使用 Espresso 和 Compose Testing，它们可以在同一个测试中共存。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Espresso 通过 ViewMatcher → ViewAction → ViewAssertion 三步完成 UI 测试</li>\n<li>Idling Resource 通知 Espresso 自定义异步操作的完成状态</li>\n<li>Espresso-Intents 验证和模拟 Intent 交互，适合测试页面跳转和系统交互</li>\n<li>自定义匹配器通过 <code>BoundedMatcher</code> 实现，扩展 Espresso 的匹配能力</li>\n<li>Espresso 与 Compose Testing 可以在混合项目中共存</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Espresso UI 测试框架","id":"espresso-ui-测试框架"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"ViewMatchers / ViewActions / ViewAssertions","id":"viewmatchers-viewactions-viewassertions"},{"level":2,"text":"Idling Resources","id":"idling-resources"},{"level":2,"text":"Intent 测试","id":"intent-测试"},{"level":2,"text":"自定义匹配器","id":"自定义匹配器"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Compose UI 测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/testing/ui-testing-compose"},"next":{"title":"截图测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/testing/screenshot-testing"}}